Ready-to-use palette (copy for new UI / AI)
Primary / Brand:     #00264D   (or hsl(219 94% 20%) via --primary)
Primary text:        #FFFFFF
Page background:     #F9FAFB   (gray-50)
Card background:     #FEFEFE / #FFFFFF
Muted surface:       #F1F5F9   (slate-100 / muted)
Border:              #E2E8F0   (slate-200)
Text primary:        #1E293B   (slate-800)
Text secondary:      #64748B   (slate-500)
Success:             #15803D   (green-700)
Danger / Reject:     #991B1B
Warning:             #CA8A04   (yellow-600)
Info:                #2563EB   (blue-600)
How screens usually combine them
Shell: gray-50 page + white card + border-primary frame
Header / nav: solid #00264D + white text
Actions: primary buttons (bg-primary text-white)
Danger actions: #991B1B or red-600
Soft highlight: bg-primary/10 + text-primary
Form fields: white input, slate border, navy focus ring
That’s the project’s color system: deep navy brand + light gray/white surfaces + green/red/amber/blue for status.


